  "bottomContent": "<div id=\"seo-intro\" style=\"padding:8px 0 0;\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,6vw,46px);letter-spacing:3px;line-height:1.1;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;margin:16px 0 10px;\">Two Truths One Lie Online</h1>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\"><strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">Two Truths One Lie</strong> is a classic ice breaker party game — now playable online with friends, family or your team, for free, on any device. No signup, no download.</p>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\">Each player writes three statements about themselves — two true and one lie. Everyone else votes on which one is the lie. The more convincing your lie, the harder it is to guess! Works great for <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">3-20 players</strong>.</p>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">Perfect as a <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">remote team ice breaker</strong> — get to know your colleagues no matter where in the world they are. Every round brings new surprises, laughs and unexpected revelations about the people you thought you knew.</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">🤥 3-20 players</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">👶 Ages 12+</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weig